    <description>Create a flow in Salesforce that signals when a new customer needs to be created in SKP.


1. Case.NCSP_Service_line__c =&quot;RM&quot;, &quot;RM Pathology&quot;, &quot;Vault Climate Control&quot;, &quot;One Time Shred&quot; or &quot;Shred&quot;
2. Opportunity Type = New Deal
3. Case Status = New
4. Case.Record Type = NCSP: SKP New Customer Set Up
5. Service Address Country: USA or CANADA.</description>
